+
+# Bulk import of tasks
+
+- New public helper `importTasks(list, text)`, exported from `src/index.ts`.
+- `text` holds one task per line, as `title;priority;tags`. An empty priority means `normal`; tags are separated by spaces. Blank lines are skipped (but still counted in line numbers).
+- Every valid line is added to the list through `list.add`, so the list's own validation and duplicate-title rule apply.
+- Returns `{ imported, rejected }`: `imported` counts the tasks added; `rejected` lists each line not added as `{ line, reason }`, `line` counting from 1. A bad line does not stop the others.
+- No new dependency, no clock, errors as data; tests in `test/import.test.ts`.
